# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AfterVue .gitignore
# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything listed here is kept off GitHub on purpose.
# If you need to add an exception, think about whether the file could contain a
# key, a token, patient data, a personal name/phone, or pricing before you do.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets and credentials (never commit, no exceptions) -------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.pem
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
service-account*.json
*-service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
gcloud-*.json
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
token.json
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets/
.secrets/
tools/stripe/catalog.json

# --- Patient data, media, exports --------------------------------------------
